      "message": "P-G2d hard-world PASS: fresh watched-memory +13.41pp over frozen head under distribution shift\n\nSoil: 4 ladder-echo ledgers built by the real qcells machinery, chain-verified,\nconstruction receipt ONLY before registration (no outcome peeking). P-G2d\nregistered under seal v6 (hardness gate head<0.90 as VOID condition + margin\n0.02), executed under v6, verdict addendum A6 under v7.\n\nVerdict: hardness gate HELD (head 73.47%), ens3 86.88% = head + 13.41pp over\n343 rows, lambda*=0 on every ledger — optimal blend was ALL fresh memory.\nWave-50 arc closes: archived priors never transfer (G2/G2b), fresh memory is\nworthless on easy soil (G2c), fresh memory on hard soil is the organism (G2d).\n\nUnified law receipted with quilt-jepa round 2 (same day): hardness is the\ngating variable for emergence claims, measured by prediction accuracy on\nheld-out structure. Wave-52 registered: hardness-aware grow(); quilt-jepa L1\noptimizer repair as precondition for latent-grid claims.",
